    "Name": "Von Luckner",
    "Details": "This refit of the Von Luckner uses Clan-made generic components that cannot be traced back to any manufacturer. The turret holds two Clan Gauss Rifles, two Clan SRM-6s and a Clan AMS, while a Clan Heavy Medium Laser in the front serves as a backup weapon. The armor was upgraded to Clan Ferro-Fibrous.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       235     40\n<b>Left</b>         165     40\n<b>Right</b>       165     40\n<b>Rear</b>        160     40\n<b>Turret</b>      235     40\n\n<b>Total</b>      960    200</color>",
    "Icon": "VonLuckner"
